msgid "Since the goal of this optimization algorithm is to find the minimum ground state of the Ising model, lower values indicate better solutions. Therefore, it's visually apparent that the solutions generated by the Fire Opal Optimization Solver far outperform random selection.\n"
msgstr "Dahil ang layunin ng optimization algorithm na ito ay hanapin ang minimum ground state ng Ising model, ang mas mababang halaga ay nagpapahiwatig ng mas mahusay na solusyon. Kaya naman, malinaw na nakikita na ang mga solusyong nabuo ng Fire Opal Optimization Solver ay lubos na natatalo ang random selection.\n"

